---
---

<section
  class="relative overflow-hidden min-h-[92vh] flex items-center"
  data-scroll-bg="#FCE8F0"
>
  <div class="container mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-16 py-16">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-center">

      <!-- 左：テキスト -->
      <div class="fade-in-up" style="animation-delay: 0.1s">
        <span class="tag bg-[#C55070] text-white mb-6 inline-block font-[--font-en] tracking-widest">
          FAN SITE
        </span>

        <h1 class="text-6xl md:text-7xl lg:text-8xl font-[--font-heading] font-extrabold mb-3 text-[#C55070] leading-tight">
          ほうとう組
        </h1>

        <p class="text-xs font-[--font-en] text-[#696969] mb-6 tracking-[0.3em]">
          HOUTOU-GUMI
        </p>

        <p class="text-sm md:text-base text-[#333333] mb-3 leading-loose max-w-sm">
          これはダミーのキャッチコピーが入ります。<br>
          ほうとう組の魅力を伝える文章がここに並びます。
        </p>
        <p class="text-xs text-[#696969] mb-10 max-w-sm">
          ※ こちらはダミーテキストです。正式な文章は後日更新予定です。
        </p>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
          <a
            href="#members"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-7 py-3 rounded-full bg-[#C55070] text-white font-bold hover:bg-[#b04060] transition-colors text-sm"
          >
            メンバーをみる
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
            </svg>
          </a>
          <a
            href="#timeline"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-7 py-3 rounded-full border-2 border-[#C55070] text-[#C55070] font-bold hover:bg-[#FCE8F0] transition-colors text-sm"
          >
            あゆみを見る
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 右：イラスト予定エリア（仮） -->
      <div
        class="hidden md:flex items-center justify-center rounded-3xl border-2 border-dashed border-[#FFB7C5]/50 h-80 lg:h-[460px] fade-in-up"
        style="animation-delay: 0.25s"
      >
        <p class="text-xs font-[--font-en] text-[#FFB7C5]/70 tracking-widest">ILLUSTRATION</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
